<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <title>toBBot Help</title>
  <style>
    body {
      font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif;
      background-color: #121212;
      color: #ffffff;
      margin: 0;
      padding: 60px 20px;
      text-align: center;
    }
    h1 {
      font-size: 3rem;
      color: #00ffc8;
      margin-bottom: 20px;
    }
    p {
      font-size: 1.3rem;
      color: #bbbbbb;
      margin-bottom: 30px;
      max-width: 700px;
      margin-left: auto;
      margin-right: auto;
    }
    ul {
      list-style-type: none;
      padding: 0;
      margin-bottom: 30px;
    }
    li {
      margin: 10px 0;
    }
    a {
      display: inline-block;
      padding: 12px 24px;
      font-size: 1rem;
      text-decoration: none;
      color: #121212;
      background-color: #00ffc8;
      border-radius: 6px;
      transition: background-color 0.3s, transform 0.2s;
    }
    a:hover {
      background-color: #00dab0;
      transform: scale(1.05);
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <h1>Help & Information</h1>
  <p>Welcome to toBBot! This general-purpose bot offers random facts, animals, memes, the weather, and other fun features to enhance your Discord experience.</p>
  <p>Available Pages:</p>
  <ul>
    <li><a href="/">Home</a></li>
    <li><a href="/console">Console Logs</a></li>
  </ul>
  <p>If you encounter any issues, please contact <strong>@vectorange</strong> on Discord.</p>
</body>
</html>
